QNX change from QNX's aports (core/binutils/0005.patch).

Taken from qnx-ports/aports core/binutils -- the APKBUILD the QNX Everywhere 8.0.4r1
image's package is built from.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific

From 015cc055174836f70a7f46fc138018b25646b84a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shivam Saxena <shisaxena@blackberry.com>
